  "description": "RQ10: empirical approximation ratio |D|/OPT on instances small enough for exhaustive exact search (n <= 16). Results describe these small instances only and say nothing about the papers' theoretical ratios. Dumbbell cells whose locked domain is not well defined (area n/density <= neck area w*l, or square side a < neck width w) are excluded before generation and recorded as generation_infeasible_under_protocol; with w = 1, l = 3 only n = 16, density 3 remains.",
